t+hypothetical-questions+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] +q | Systemprovider", :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 2, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 1, :golden-read? true, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "939545886fa9;d86b0c860b67", :enrichment-hits 85, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 1.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 1, :prompt-tokens 6458, :pool-head "", :repeat 0, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "939545886fa9", :expected-chunk-ids "939545886fa9", :elapsed-ms 391986, :issued-queries "behandle meldinger manuelt vs API integrasjon | mottak av meldinger med vedlegg API | store mengder meldinger Altinn anbefaling | hvordan håndtere store volum av meldinger i Altinn", :timestamp "2026-06-10T03:37:20.569947Z", :total-tokens 7092, :run-id "a43dfdfb-58b1-4e95-a3ac-21db232e44b1", :golden-display-rank 1, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "public-docs", :length-finish? false, :recall-at-5 1.0} {:response "SMS notifications are sent between 09:00 and 17:00 [1]. If the sending time falls outside of this window, the notification will be sent the following day [1].\n\nRegarding reminders (revarsel) for unread messages:\n*   In general, a reminder is sent after 7 days if the message has not been read/opened [1], [2].\n*   In test and staging environments, the reminder is sent after 1 day if the message remains unread [1].", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? false, :question-id "ue-corr-04-notification-order-sms-window", :empty? false, :llm-calls 2, :citation-recall 0.0, :completion-tokens 770, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 0.0, :config-id "deployed", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "altinn-correspondence,hard", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "da960f8906327 R12.0 P2.5 h2.0 or1.2 L10384 0/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] +q | Notifications", :source "new", :sear