 øyeblikkelig og døgnet rundt:\n\n*   **Umiddelbar varsling**: Dette er en variant av varslingstjenesten som sender meldinger **øyeblikkelig** til én mottaker via e-post eller SMS [1]. Funksjonen er spesifikt beskrevet som nyttig for situasjoner der brukeren venter på informasjon for å komme videre, som for eksempel en engangskode (OTP) ved innlogging [1]. Ved bruk av umiddelbar varsling omgår meldingen køen og sendes direkte til meldingsgatewayen [1]. For dette formålet kan man bruke følgende endepunkter [2]:\n    *   `POST /future/orders/instant/sms` for SMS-varsling [2].\n    *   `POST /future/orders/instant/email` for e-postvarsling [2].\n\n*   **Vanlig varsling**: I de fleste tilfeller er vanlig varsling tilstrekkelig [1]. For å tillate utsending hele døg…", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "ue-notif-05-umiddelbar-varsling-otp", :empty? false, :llm-calls 2, :citation-recall 1.0, :completion-tokens 772, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 1.0, :config-id "deployed", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "altinn-notifications,hard", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "d5e8f2f62095c R21.7 P3.6 h3.0 or2.2 L1450 1/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] +q | Instant notifications", :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 3, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 2, :golden-read? true, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "046877b17d91;f402534c7a05;30e16cfa3f81", :enrichment-hits 66, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 1.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 2, :prompt-tokens 6503, :pool-head "d5e8f2f62095c R23.9 P3.6 h3.0 or1.5 L406 0/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] +q | Instant notifications", :repeat 0, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "046877b17d91;30e16cfa3f81", :expected-chunk-ids "046877b17d91", :elapsed-ms 466583, :issued-queries "send engangskode OTP øyeblikkelig varsling | real-time notification Altinn API | varsling døgnet rundt OTP innlogging | hvordan sende OTP til bruker i Altinn", :timestamp "2026-06-10T03:51:50.345614Z", :total-tokens 7275, :run-id "c150db75-0dd7-4bfc-a5a4-c14981ce3f52", :golden-display-rank 2, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "public-docs", :length-finish? false, :recall-at-5 1.0} {:response "For å sette en egen e-postadresse som avsender på varsler via API-et, må du inkludere feltet `senderEmailAddress` i `emailSettings`-objektet i API-kallet når du bestiller varsler [1]. Eksempler på bruk finnes i Bruno-testen \"Fulfilling eForv. §8 - custom sender\" [1].\n\nFor å kunne ta i bruk et eget domene som avsenderadresse, må man gjennom en registrerings- og verifiseringsprosess bestående av følgende steg [1]:\n\n1.  **Henvendelse:** Tjenesteeier sender en support-sak til `tjenesteeier@altinn.no` med ønske om egendefinert avsender for Altinn Varsling og den ønskede avsenderadressen [2]. Tilgangen gis til eksplisitte adresser (f.eks. `noreply@example.com`), ikke hele domener, men det er mulig å bestille flere adresser [2].\n2.  **Registrering:** Digdir registrerer domenet og utsteder verifis…", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "ue-notif-06-egendefinert-avsender-epost-dns", :empty? false, :llm-calls 2, :citation-recall 1.0, :completion-tokens 645, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 1.0, :config-id "deployed", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "altinn-notifications,hard", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "d286593dbb706 R18.6 P3.7 h3.0 or1.3 L1179 3/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions+metadata b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.2,0.0] +q | Custom sender", :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 3, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 1, :golden-read? true, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "aa73725749c0;2156a98761c2;36849d0a53e6", :enrichment-hits 69, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 1.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 3, :prompt-tokens 6397, :pool-head "", :repeat 0, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "aa73725749c0;2156a98761c2;36849d0a53e6", :expected-chunk-ids "aa73725749c0", :elapsed-ms 805206, :issued-queries "sette egen e-postadresse avsender varsler API | bruke eget domene varslinger Altinn | konfigurere avsenderadresse for varsel", :timestamp "2026-06-10T04:05:15.553442Z", :total-tokens 7042, :run-id "1fb4e6b7-ce63-4bd4-a8ea-e53491739cd4", :golden-display-rank 1, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "public-docs", :length-finish? false, :recall-at-5 1.0} {:response "Dersom ingen annen konfigurasjon eksisterer, gjelder følgende avsendere [1]:\n\n*   **SMS:** Avsender er **Altinn**, mens det i testmiljøet er **Altinn-test** [1].\n*   **Epost:** Avsender er **noreply@altinn**. For testmiljøet er avsender **noreply-tt02@altinn.no**, og for ytelsestestmiljøet er avsender **noreply@altinn.cloud** [1].", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "ue-notif-07-standard-avsender-sms-epost", :empty? false, :llm-calls 2, :citation-recall 1.0, :completion-tokens 406, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 1.0, :config-id "deployed", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "altinn-notifications,hard", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "d286593dbb706 R21.6 P3.7 h3.0 or2.0 L774 0/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] +q | Custom sender", :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 1, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 1, :golden-read? true, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "1ae507a826c4", :enrichment-hits 50, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 1.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 1, :prompt-tokens 6514, :pool-head "", :repeat 0, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "1ae507a826c4", :expected-chunk-ids "1ae507a826c4", :elapsed-ms 259846, :issued-queries "Altinn Varsling standard avsender SMS e-post | Altinn Varsling default sender SMS email | hvem vises som avsender i Altinn Varsling uten konfigurasjon", :timestamp "2026-06-10T04:09:35.401770Z", :total-tokens 6920, :run-id "8726d42e-0525-49e6-b193-6ece18b4ecf9", :golden-display-rank 1, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "public-docs", :length-finish? false, :recall-at-5 1.0} {:response "Aktivitetsloggen i Dialogporten er en logg som fylles ut med informasjon om tidligere aktiviteter knyttet til en bestemt dialog [2]. Den beskrives som en uforanderlig liste over tidsstemplede oppføringer av bestemte typer som viser historikken gjennom hele dialogens levetid [2]. Eksempler på slike aktiviteter er opprettelsen av dialogen, meldinger sendt fra tjenesteeieren, data sendt inn av parten, utførte signaturer eller betalinger, eller at en forsendelse åpnes [2].\n\nNår det gjelder hvem som fyller ut loggen/historikken, bruker kildene to ulike betegnelser:\n* Kilde [1] opplyser at det er **tjenesteleverandøren** som fyller aktivitetshistorikken etter hvert som ulike tilstandsendringer skjer.\n* Kilde [2] opplyser at det er **tjenesteeieren** som fyller ut aktivitetsloggen og har ansvaret…", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "ue-dialog-01-aktivitetslogg", :empty? false, :llm-calls 2, :citation-recall 1.0, :completion-tokens 390, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 1.0, :config-id "deployed", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "altinn-dialogporten,hard", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "dfd39a68c8de7 R20.0 P2.5 h2.0 or1.6 L2058 0/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] +q | Activity log", :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 2, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 3, :golden-read? true, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "294db2090e8b;58d02570ed96", :enrichment-hits 48, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 1.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 2, :prompt-tokens 6305, :pool-head "db5bf7b3760d7 R21.6 P3.7 h3.0 or1.1 L803 1/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions+metadata b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.2,0.0] +q | About dialogporten ;; de8985669f0ad R20.6 P3.5 h3.0 or1.1 L618 8/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] +q | Dialogs", :repeat 0, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "294db2090e8b;58d02570ed96", :expected-chunk-ids "58d02570ed96", :elapsed-ms 349503, :issued-queries "Hva er aktivitetsloggen i Dialogporten? | hvem fyller ut aktivitetsloggen i Dialogporten? | Dialogporten aktivitetslogg definisjon", :timestamp "2026-06-10T04:15:24.908519Z", :total-tokens 6695, :run-id "67c5e5f7-3169-42b3-836e-d109ce5210da", :golden-display-rank 3, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "public-docs", :length-finish? false, :recall-at-5 1.0} {:response "In Dialogporten, a dialog is considered \"seen\" in the seen log when a particular dialog ID has been requested from the API [1, 2], which means that details for a single dialog are retrieved from the API [1].\n\nUsing the search or list API does not count and does not cause the seen log to be populated [1, 2]; similarly, \"set-hendelser\" (seen events) are not sent as a result of requests to the search or list API [1].", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "ue-dialog-02-seen-log", :empty? false, :llm-calls 3, :citation-recall 0.0, :completion-tokens 867, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 1.0, :config-id "deployed", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "altinn-dialogporten,hard", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "d7d5b35931f86 R14.3 P3.7 h3.0 or2.0 L1534 0/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] +q | Seen log", :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 3, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 