ted with the action or transmission are replaced with the special value `urn:dialogporten:unauthorized`.\n*   **Authorization Flag**: These entities have an `isAuthorized` flag, which will be set to `false` in this case.\n\n**Important Note:** Although Dialogporten removes the actual URLs and indicates that the action is unauthorized, service providers must still perform their own authentication and authorization on all incoming requests to their endpoints rather than relying solely on Dialogporten's obscuring of the URLs.", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "stop", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "ue-dialog-03-unauthorized-urls", :empty? false, :llm-calls 2, :citation-recall 0.0, :completion-tokens 569, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 0.0, :config-id "deployed", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "altinn-dialogporten,hard", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "d3db194d20572 R25.0 P2.5 h2.0 or0.7 L462 3/? ty:content+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] | Getting dialog details", :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 0, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 2, :golden-read? false, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "", :enrichment-hits 53, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 0.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 0, :prompt-tokens 5910, :pool-head "d3f5d66423a1e R25.2 P2.6 h2.0 or1.2 L702 2/? ty:content+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] | Altinn authorization", :repeat 0, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "", :expected-chunk-ids "7862f7d4c489", :elapsed-ms 110425, :issued-queries "Dialogporten action transmission authorization unauthorized URL | Dialogporten access denied action transmission | Hva skjer med URL ved manglende autorisasjon Dialogporten action transmission", :timestamp "2026-06-10T04:23:45.391307Z", :total-tokens 6479, :run-id "b1a1278e-ba8e-4510-a9d1-08a7f2422bbb", :golden-display-rank 2, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "pu